    "detailed_description": "Superhero I.T. Software currently has <strong>10</strong> levels.<br><br><strong>Log in and defend the company network from the virus invasion, or lose your sysadmin privileges trying.</strong><br><br>Use a variety of system tools to fend off hordes of virus bugs which seek to compromise the network's process kernels. Collect permission powerups and face off against a variety of hostile malwares trying to get in your way.<br><br>Secure the network with firewalls, or counter-compromise the hacker's malware processes before your kernels are cracked by the attack.",
